							In memory of Deen Quickheal
<p>
>From his name, <br>
I can gather,<br>
He was one of pure devotion.
<p>
When a friend was low on life.
He was quickly there.<br>
gladly laying his life, 
For that of a friend.
<p>
I'm sure he brought joy to all the lives,<br>
He touched as he went through our world.<br>
Cheering a friend up when down,<br> 
or giving a boost to a young fighter.
<p>
I know his family will miss him.<br>
I know his friends will too,
And I'm sure if I knew him, I would cry a tear.
<p>
Deen Quickheal, I'm sure, a friend to all<br>
Will be missed in our world, 
As well as the one beyond.
